w:File\"><img alt=\"Red Quiver\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Red_Quiver_7aa039.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td>Red Quiver</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">400 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Refined Bow\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Refined_Bow_9a3ba1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td>Refined Bow</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">600 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Spear\"><img alt=\"Spear\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spear_5c898c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Spear\">Spear</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">9 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Xed.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nXed: Greetings, <i>Player</i>. Welcome to the distance fighting booth of the Ironhouse where you can buy bows, crossbows and ammunition.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nXed: I am the humble supplier for distance fighting weapons of the Ironhouse, owned by Abran Ironeye.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nXed: People call me Xed, but my full name is Xedem.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Xedem</b><br/>\nXed: Yeah, nice name, eh?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Abran Ironeye</b><br/>\nXed: He is the owner of this market, although - just between you and me - I'm not so sure he's honest.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>ware</b><br/>\nXed: My offers are bows, crossbows and ammunition. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a trade.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>news</b><br/>\nXed: Some people say Ferumbras isn't really dead. Crazy kids!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>ferumbras</b><br/>\nXed: I heard rumours somewhere that his father was called Hugo.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>excalibug</b><br/>\nXed: I think that was the sword they were talking about. Said something about a man in Edron that could get it for him.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>equipment</b><br/>\nXed: My offers are bows, crossbows and ammunition. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a trade.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\nXed: I don't know, maybe what you really need is a watch.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nXed: Goodbye <i>Player</i>, and may the gods be with you.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Xed</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":32904,"y":32117,"z":6}}